<title>GERMANY: Audi says 1996 sales up 12.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Audi says 1996 sales up 12.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Worldwide sales			    18,800  vs 16,700</p>
<p>    Share of foreign sales		   49 pct  vs 46 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Audi AG. The company also said it planned to produce more than 500,000 vehicles in 1997. Audi is a unit of Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
